I wrote code to (naively) perform automatic memoisation. I tried to write it in a functional programming style, and so did not make use of any global variables.
My Code
def naive_memoise(caches):
    def memoise(f):
        nonlocal caches
        def mem_f(n):
            nonlocal caches, f
            if f not in caches:
                caches[f] = {}
            if n not in caches[f]:
                caches[f][n] = f(n)
            return caches[f][n]
        return mem_f
    return memoise

