You could consider the strategy pattern here. Just keep you single Calibration class but inject an enumerable of IAnalyzer, IVerifier and IReportGenerator. In the DoCalibration method you will then look for the Analyzer that suits the current Report and so on, if no type specific one is found you fall back to the default one. This will keep things more loosely coupled and follows the Open–closed principle.

